{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lusty Rhythm: JOI Combat</strong> is an <strong>adult rhythm-combat experience</strong> where temptation, timing, and tactics collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in pulse-pounding rhythm battles against seductive monster girls across a branching map full of choices and surprises. Strike in sync with the music, manage your health and mana, and unleash powerful spells to claim victory over vampires, demons, monsters and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple paths through the map \u2014 each offering different encounters, rewards, and challenges. Randomized loot and upgrade options make every playthrough unique, encouraging you to experiment and replay for new experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every opponent features distinct voice acting and anime-inspired artwork, creating a gallery of personalities to discover as you conquer each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Rhythm-based combat with altered tracks across varied stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b Adult themes featuring seductive, anime-styled monster girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f RPG progression with spells, stat upgrades, and random rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa Branching map paths offering replayability and player choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Simple, one-handed controls \u2014 mouse or keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a Unique character voices and immersive sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keep the rhythm. Control your focus. Conquer your desires.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089890?t=1761892398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089890?t=1761892398","capsul